OL,3,AGovernment failures allowed Covid to
OL,4,A'spread like wildfire' in care homes,
OL,5,Ainquiry says
OL,6,
OL,7,FGovernment failures created
OL,8,Fenvironments in care settings in which
OL,9,FCovid could spread like wildfire, an
OL,10,Finquiry report says
OL,12,FMinisters' claims of there being a
OL,13,F"protective ring" around care homes at
OL,14,Fthe start of Covid were unfounded, the
OL,15,Freport says
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/40
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
