OL,3,AMarseille braces for more unrest after
OL,4,Aprotests give way to 'apocalyptic'
OL,5,Adisorder
OL,6,
OL,7,FA police union boss told the BBC that
OL,8,Fthe weekend had been an "apocalyptic"
OL,9,Fhell for his colleagues. 118 officers
OL,10,Fwere injured, representing more than a
OL,11,Ftenth of the national figure.
OL,13,FSo far, 101 arrests have been made in
OL,14,Fthe port city, a quarter of them
OL,15,Fchildren.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/40
